WEBVTT

00:00:10.900 --> 00:00:11.950
别动。
Don't move.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:17.300
告诉我……
Tell me...

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.100
你到底是从哪里来的？
Where did you come from?

00:00:20.301 --> 00:00:22.601
你：（不挣开）我是楼上宴会的摄影师。你的眼睛怎么回事？
You: (Don't pull away.) I'm the photographer for the party upstairs. What's wrong with your eyes?

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:27.501
摄影师。你是来拍我订婚的。
A photographer. You came to shoot my engagement.

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:30.501
眼睛？那是你害的。
The eyes? That's your doing.

00:00:30.701 --> 00:00:34.501
Harland把订婚宣布提前了。十分钟后。
Harland moved the engagement announcement up. Ten minutes.

00:00:37.863 --> 00:00:40.163
你：我害的？什么意思？
You: My doing? What do you mean?

00:00:40.263 --> 00:00:45.063
你的气息，总让我失控。
Your scent. It does this to me.

00:00:48.763 --> 00:00:55.063
原来你在这儿。Mate。这就是你对我的意义。
There you are. Mate. That's what you are to me.

00:00:55.425 --> 00:00:57.725
你：和他一起上车
You: Get into the car with him

00:00:57.825 --> 00:01:02.625
上车。拜托。
Get in. Please.

00:01:04.325 --> 00:01:08.125
你的气息现在在我身上。每一匹狼都会知道。
Your scent is on me now. Every wolf will know.

00:01:09.325 --> 00:01:12.625
在我的庄园里，没人能碰你。
At my estate, no one can touch you.

00:01:12.987 --> 00:01:15.287
你：那“mate”到底是什么意思？全都告诉我。
You: So what does 'mate' actually mean? Tell me everything.

00:01:15.387 --> 00:01:20.187
一个女人，为一匹狼而生。没有什么能凌驾其上。
One woman. Made for one wolf. Nothing outranks it.

00:01:24.387 --> 00:01:30.187
他们现在会来找你。让他们来。
They'll come looking for you now. Let them.

00:01:30.549 --> 00:01:32.849
你：一直给你打电话的是谁？是她吗？
You: Who keeps calling you? Is it her?

00:01:32.949 --> 00:01:37.749
Selene。她现在对我毫无意义。
Selene. She means nothing to me now.

00:01:39.949 --> 00:01:43.249
那是我的气息。在这里，到处都是。
It's my scent. Here, it's everywhere.

00:01:43.449 --> 00:01:47.749
一会儿就好了。我早该提醒你。
It'll settle. I should have warned you.

00:01:48.111 --> 00:01:50.411
你：跟着他走进起居室
You: Follow him into the living room

00:01:50.511 --> 00:01:55.311
这边走，靠近我。
This way. Stay close.

00:01:57.011 --> 00:02:01.311
闻到你气味的那一刻，我就丢下了它。
I walked out on it the moment I caught your scent.

00:02:02.511 --> 00:02:03.811
你在发抖。
You're shaking.

00:02:05.673 --> 00:02:07.973
你：那是谁？你在等人吗？
You: Who's that? Were you expecting someone?

00:02:08.073 --> 00:02:10.373
不，我没有在等人。
No. I wasn't expecting anyone.

00:02:10.573 --> 00:02:12.873
我认得那引擎声。
I know that engine.

00:02:13.073 --> 00:02:15.873
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:18.073 --> 00:02:20.873
他会见我的。
He'll receive me.

00:02:23.235 --> 00:02:25.535
你：把手按在他的背上
You: Press your hand to his back

00:02:25.635 --> 00:02:30.435
待在我身后。
Stay behind me.

00:02:30.635 --> 00:02:32.935
原来是真的。
So it's true.

00:02:33.135 --> 00:02:36.935
她不用你操心，Selene。
She is not your concern, Selene.

00:02:40.797 --> 00:02:43.097
你：她说的满月是什么意思？看着我。
You: What did she mean by full moon? Look at me.

00:02:43.197 --> 00:02:46.997
长老会按满月行事。她只知道这些。
The Council moves by the full moon. That's all she knows.

00:02:48.197 --> 00:02:50.997
我不会让他们得逞。
I won't let them.

00:02:54.697 --> 00:02:57.997
跟我来，去个安静点的地方。
Come with me. Somewhere quieter.

00:02:58.359 --> 00:03:00.659
你：牵起他的手，跟他走
You: Take his hand and go with him

00:03:00.759 --> 00:03:05.559
那你带路吧，我跟着你。
Lead me, then. I'll follow.

00:03:07.259 --> 00:03:10.559
再说一遍，你不害怕。
Say it again. That you're not afraid.

00:03:13.259 --> 00:03:15.559
今晚留在我身边。
Stay with me tonight.

00:03:15.921 --> 00:03:18.221
你：我不害怕。我会留下，但不许再有秘密。
You: I'm not afraid. I'll stay, but no more secrets.

00:03:18.321 --> 00:03:21.621
不再有秘密。我向你保证。
No more secrets. You have my word.

00:03:23.321 --> 00:03:27.121
我不是人类。从来都不是。
I'm not human. I never was.

00:03:30.321 --> 00:03:33.121
Luca：Alpha，事态紧急。
:Luca: Alpha. It's urgent.

00:03:33.483 --> 00:03:35.783
你：接吧。但我要和你一起去。
You: Answer it. But I'm coming with you.

00:03:35.883 --> 00:03:38.683
进来，Luca。
Come in, Luca.

00:03:40.883 --> 00:03:44.683
Luca：Harland召集了长老。他们今晚就要带走她。
:Luca: Harland called the elders. They want her tonight.

00:03:44.883 --> 00:03:48.183
那他们会当面听到我的回答。
Then they'll hear my answer in person.
